          },
          {
            "en": "It has a rather complex meaning and as far as we can tell it translates to 'army of those who are many, dedicated to the ultimate time of mayhem and despair'. ... \\z\n\tOther, more handy names are army of the last battlefield, army of the last days, legion of mayhem, dread legion or simply the {legion}.",
            "key": "npc.jack_springer.stdmod_24",
            "source": "tm",
            "translated": "Ma dość złożone znaczenie i, o ile możemy stwierdzić, przekłada się na 'army of those who are many, dedicated to the ultimate time of mayhem and despair'. ... \\ z\n\tInne, bardziej przydatne nazwy to armia ostatniego pola bitwy, armia dni ostatnich, legion chaosu, legion grozy lub po prostu {legion}."
